  "title": "National Beverage Corp. Innovation Fuels Optimism . . . Reports Improved Operating Profit",
  "summary": "FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Mar. 6, 2025-- National Beverage Corp. (NASDAQ: FIZZ) today announced results for its third quarter ended January 25, 2025 . For the Three Months: Net sales were $267 million . Operating profit increased 5% to $51 million . Earnings per share were $.42 .",
